//   EnterConfigurationMode: OK
//   ExitConfigurationMode: OK
//   EnterInitializationMode: OK
//   ExitInitializationMode: OK
//   GetFloat64 x: OK = 1.0000
//   Terminate: OK
//  twice, and the instance can still be freed
//   EnterConfigurationMode: OK
//   EnterConfigurationMode: Error
//  Exit without Enter
//   ExitConfigurationMode: Error
//  Enter after initialization: there is no Reconfiguration Mode
//   EnterInitializationMode: OK
//   EnterConfigurationMode: Error
//   EnterInitializationMode: OK
//   ExitInitializationMode: OK
//   EnterConfigurationMode: Error
//  what Configuration Mode refuses, a fresh instance each
